{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18610","headline":"奉酬杨侍郎丈因送八叔拾遗戏赠诏追南来诸宾二首 一 · 柳宗元","name":"奉酬杨侍郎丈因送八叔拾遗戏赠诏追南来诸宾二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贞一来时送彩牋，一行归雁慰惊弦。\n翰林寂寞谁爲主，鸣凤应须早上天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}